      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. This order is not intended to restrict speech or conduct that is protected under the First Amendment. Antisemitic acts are criminal only when they are so defined by law, and this order does not establish civil or criminal liability for any acts.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
